Everything is implemented and verified. Here's what was done:

**`app/auth.py`** — `require_api_key` now:
- Returns 401 with `"API key is missing"` when `X-API-Key` header is absent
- Returns 401 with `"Invalid API key"` when the key doesn't match `VALID_API_KEYS`
- Returns the username on success

**`app/main.py`** — 3 new endpoints, 1 modified:

| Endpoint | Change |
|---|---|
| `GET /tasks` | Added optional `status`, `priority`, `assigned_to` filters + `page`/`page_size` pagination |
| `POST /tasks` | Auth-protected; validates `project_id` (404 if missing); auto-assigns next integer ID |
| `PUT /tasks/{task_id}` | Auth-protected; partial-update via `TaskUpdate` fields; 404 if not found |
| `DELETE /tasks/{task_id}` | Auth-protected; removes from in-memory list; 404 if not found |

Each verified against a running instance — all status codes, error messages, and data transformations match spec.
